WEBVTT

00:35:00.038 --> 00:35:04.413
which for a pope is quite extraordinary
to say something like that.

00:35:05.288 --> 00:35:10.204
And I think he's done a lot to persuade
Catholics to take more concern for

00:35:10.204 --> 00:35:11.204
the environment.

00:35:12.954 --> 00:35:17.246
It's funny to hear you say that because
I think you paved the way

00:35:17.246 --> 00:35:21.371
for the kind of entrepreneurial activism
that he's done in his work.

00:35:22.329 --> 00:35:24.204
That goes to something else
I wanted to ask you about,

00:35:24.204 --> 00:35:28.704
which is as you moved into activism, both,
you know,

00:35:28.788 --> 00:35:31.871
to protect animals and now the
environment and our planet,